se symmetry and cylinder volume","methodDirectNodeIds":{"half-cylinder-by-symmetry":["cnm_p207","cnm_p171"]},"nodeIds":["cnm_p207","cnm_p171","cnm_p179","cnm_p188","cnm_p189","cnm_p192","cnm_p206"]}]},{"additionalConceptCount":7,"answerCheck":{"derivedAnswer":"C (50 inches)","reason":"The center occupies 1 - 4(3/16) = 1/4 of the square. Its area is 100²/4 = 2500 square inches, and √2500 = 50 inches.","status":"matches"},"assessed":false,"bank":"amc","coverage":"canonical_concept_only","flags":[],"questionId":"1995_AMC_8_Q18","reviewStatus":"machine_scope_audited","routes":[{"contextNodeIds":["cnm_p088","cnm_p035","cnm_p080","cnm_p177"],"id":"remaining-area","label":"Find the area left for the center","methodDirectNodeIds":{"remaining-area":["cnm_p150","cnm_p089","cnm_p179","cnm_075"]},"nodeIds":["cnm_p150","cnm_p089","cnm_p179","cnm_075","cnm_p088","cnm_p035","cnm_p080","cnm_p177"]}]},{"additionalConceptCount":7,"answerCheck":{"derivedAnswer":"D: 1925 coins","reason":"Let m be the last share. Working backward gives amounts m*12^j/j! for 0<=j<=11. Since 11!=2^8*3^4*5^2*7*11, the initial amount being integral forces 1925 to divide m. Taking m=1925 makes every intermediate amount integral and positive. Since the initial amount is proportional to m, this also minimizes it.","status":"matches"},"assessed":false,"bank":"amc","coverage":"canonical_concept_only","flags":[],"questionId":"2013_AMC_10A_Q21","reviewStatus":"machine_adjudicated","routes":[{"contextNodeIds":["cnm_p179","cnm_p153","math:factorial-notation","math:prime-factorization"],"id":"solution:backward-denominator-lcm:3a81bf14c761","label":"Work backward and clear the denominators","methodDirectNodeIds":{"backward-denominator-lcm":["math:integer-diophantine-equations","cnm_p183","cnm_p168","cnm_p159"]},"nodeIds":["math:integer-diophantine-equations","cnm_p183","cnm_p168","cnm_p159","cnm_p179","cnm_p153","math:factorial-notation","math:prime-factorization"]}]}],"layer":"ailleo","meaning":"Reviewed content-boun